8	 * Items are plain objects with a configurable key property (keyProperty) and value property (valueProperty).
9	 *
10	 * This base class provides only read/search/iteration/transform methods.
11	 * See PropertyList for static-mode mutation methods.
12	 * See CookieList for async cookie-jar write methods.
13	 *
14	 * Convention:
15	 *   #field / #method  – truly private, inaccessible to subclasses
16	 *   _field / _method  – protected, intended for subclass access only
17	 */
