24	   * @param {object} options
25	   * @param {string} [options.keyProperty='key'] - The property name used as the unique key
26	   * @param {string} [options.valueProperty='value'] - The property name used as the value
27	   * @param {Function} [options.dataSource] - Dynamic data source function (returns array of items)
28	   * @param {Array} [options.items] - Initial items for static mode
29	   */
30	  // Items are stored in an array (not a Map) to support positional access (idx, indexOf),
31	  // ordered insertion (insert, insertAfter, prepend in PropertyList), and duplicate keys.
32	  // At typical list sizes (cookies, headers) the O(n) key lookup is negligible.
